# U-Boot / Firmware Images
# ------------------------------------------------------------

*.img
*.bin
*.dump
*.raw
*.rom
*.fw
*.dtb
*.itb
*.fit

# Backup / extracted firmware data
backups/
backup/
firmware/
firmware_backups/
extracted/


